---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProcessingTimeLookup from '../../components/tools/ProcessingTimeLookup.jsx';
---
<BaseLayout title="Visa Processing Times: Official Tools for Pakistani Applicants" description="Find official visa processing information by destination. Separate appointment waits, application decisions and passport return without relying on stale estimates.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Visa Processing Time Lookup</h1>
    <p class="mb-8">Choose a destination to find its official processing service and understand what the estimate covers. A fixed country-wide figure can be misleading when the route, office or application date changes.</p>
    <ProcessingTimeLookup client:load />
    <section class="prose max-w-none mt-10">
      <h2>Three different waiting periods</h2>
      <p>First, you may wait for an appointment. Next comes application processing, which begins at the point defined by the authority. Finally, passport return or delivery can take additional time. Do not add a quoted decision estimate to today’s date and treat it as a guaranteed travel date.</p>
      <h2>Working days and calendar days</h2>
      <p>Use the unit shown by the official service. Working-day estimates exclude the relevant non-working days; local and consular holidays can affect scheduling. Check when the authority considers your application complete and what happens if it requests more evidence.</p>
      <h2>Faster services</h2>
      <p>A premium lounge, courier upgrade or paid document-upload service is not necessarily faster government decision-making. UK priority and super-priority availability is route-specific. Review <a href="https://www.gov.uk/faster-decision-visa-settlement">UKVI’s official faster-decision rules</a> before paying, including the separate treatment of family applications.</p>
      <h2>Canada’s closed Student Direct Stream</h2>
      <p>Do not plan around the former SDS fast-processing option. IRCC ended it on 8 November 2024. Use the current study-permit process and official time checker. <a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/notices/end-student-direct-stream-nigeria-student-express.html">IRCC closure notice</a>.</p>
      <h2>A practical timeline</h2>
      <p>Record the earliest application date, appointment date, evidence deadlines, official processing estimate and passport-return method separately. If a deadline matters, contact the authority through its prescribed channel. Do not pay a third party that guarantees an embassy appointment or approval.</p>
      <p>Use our <a href="/tools/visa-fee-calculator/">fee calculator</a> for budgeting and your destination’s <a href="/guides/">guide</a> for a preparation plan.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
